    "name": "Goodnight Icarus",
    "steam_appid": 2658430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658430/extras/04fb78139c0261ea73cb41b2b7df2908.avif?t=1703780215\" width=584 height=108 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Introduction</u></h2>&quot;Goodnight Icarus&quot; is a 2D RPG with a Western fantasy setting and elements of mild horror. The story revolves around the protagonist, &quot;Icarus,&quot; who rarely leaves her room, as she experiences strange events on her birthday.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Features</u></h2>Immersive scares and horror elements that make players feel like they're part of the game.<br>Appropriate and enjoyable puzzles and exploration that await players to uncover the mysteries of the story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Art</u></h2>A 2D pixel art style that creates a unique fantasy world.<br>Cute yet creepy CG images that allow players to experience a blend of different emotions throughout the game.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658430/extras/04fb78139c0261ea73cb41b2b7df2908.avif?t=1703780215\" width=584 height=108 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Introduction</u></h2>&quot;Goodnight Icarus&quot; is a 2D RPG with a Western fantasy setting and elements of mild horror. The story revolves around the protagonist, &quot;Icarus,&quot; who rarely leaves her room, as she experiences strange events on her birthday.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Features</u></h2>Immersive scares and horror elements that make players feel like they're part of the game.<br>Appropriate and enjoyable puzzles and exploration that await players to uncover the mysteries of the story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Art</u></h2>A 2D pixel art style that creates a unique fantasy world.<br>Cute yet creepy CG images that allow players to experience a blend of different emotions throughout the game.",
    "short_description": "&quot;It's dangerous out there.&quot; - Icarus has always believed in her brother's words. However, she finds herself trapped in an cycle of death on her birthday. Through explorations, anonymous diaries, terrifying monsters, reflection of herself in the mirror... her fate seems to have been predetermined.",
